      "output": "Focus this week on two high\u2011impact blocks:\n\n1. **Internship CV** \u2013\u202fFinish a polished version.  \n   \u2022\u202fDay\u202f1\u20112: Draft all sections (education, projects, skills, experience).  \n   \u2022\u202fDay\u202f3: Refine wording, add measurable results, and tailor the summary to the target role.  \n   \u2022\u202fDay\u202f4: Peer\u2011review or get feedback (ask a mentor, friend, or use the CV\u2011Specialist).  \n   \u2022\u202fDay\u202f5: Incorporate feedback, format cleanly, and export PDF.\n\n2. **Programming exam preparation** \u2013\u202fBuild solid coverage before the exam in 10\u202fdays.  \n   \u2022\u202fDay\u202f1\u20112: Review lecture notes / syllabus, list topics, and rank by weight.  \n   \u2022\u202fDay\u202f3\u20115: Do focused practice on the top\u2011ranked topics (solve 5\u20137 problems each day).  \n   \u2022\u202fDay\u202f6\u20117: Take a timed mock test, identify weak spots, and review those areas.\n\n**Next step:**\u202fBlock two 2\u2011hour windows each day\u2014one for the CV (morning) and one for exam prep (afternoon). Let me know if you have other commitments this week so I can adjust the schedule.",
